    "opentalktype://start?mode=dictate         Start dictating in the given mode\nopentalktype://stop                       Finish this session, clean up and paste\nopentalktype://cancel                     Cancel this session, paste nothing, record nothing\nopentalktype://run?mode=dictate&text=…    Skip the microphone and clean up this text\nopentalktype://paste-last                 Paste the previous result again": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opentalktype://start?mode=dictate         Im angegebenen Modus diktieren\nopentalktype://stop                       Diese Sitzung beenden, bereinigen und einfügen\nopentalktype://cancel                     Diese Sitzung abbrechen, nichts einfügen, nichts sichern\nopentalktype://run?mode=dictate&text=…    Mikrofon überspringen und diesen Text bereinigen\nopentalktype://paste-last                 Das vorige Ergebnis erneut einfügen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opentalktype://start?mode=dictate         Dictar en el modo indicado\nopentalktype://stop                       Terminar esta sesión, limpiar y pegar\nopentalktype://cancel                     Cancelar esta sesión, no pegar ni guardar nada\nopentalktype://run?mode=dictate&text=…    Saltarse el micrófono y limpiar este texto\nopentalktype://paste-last                 Volver a pegar el resultado anterior"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opentalktype://start?mode=dictate         Dicter dans le mode indiqué\nopentalktype://stop                       Terminer cette session, nettoyer et coller\nopentalktype://cancel                     Annuler cette session, ne rien coller ni enregistrer\nopentalktype://run?mode=dictate&text=…    Sauter le microphone et nettoyer ce texte\nopentalktype://paste-last                 Recoller le résultat précédent"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opentalktype://start?mode=dictate         指定したモードでディクテーションを開始\nopentalktype://stop                       この回を終了し、整理して貼り付け\nopentalktype://cancel                     この回をキャンセル、貼り付けも記録もなし\nopentalktype://run?mode=dictate&text=…    マイクを使わず、このテキストを整理\nopentalktype://paste-last                 前回の結果をもう一度貼り付け"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opentalktype://start?mode=dictate         지정한 모드로 받아쓰기 시작\nopentalktype://stop                       이번 세션을 끝내고 정리해서 붙여넣기\nopentalktype://cancel                     이번 세션 취소, 붙여넣기도 기록도 없음\nopentalktype://run?mode=dictate&text=…    마이크를 건너뛰고 이 텍스트를 정리\nopentalktype://paste-last                 이전 결과를 다시 붙여넣기"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opentalktype://start?mode=dictate         開始聽寫，指定模式\nopentalktype://stop                       結束這一次，整理並貼上\nopentalktype://cancel                     取消這一次，不貼上也不留紀錄\nopentalktype://run?mode=dictate&text=…    跳過麥克風，直接整理這段文字\nopentalktype://paste-last                 把上一次的結果再貼一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
